    {
      "id": "n_run_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 462,
      "y": 1318,
      "width": 1011.3600000000001,
      "height": 122.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 527603372,
      "version": 9,
      "versionNonce": 994035141,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791580315473,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "run-id CORRELATION (observed, telemetry-map 0.12-0.14)\n- The run-... id is in the URL PATH (/policy/run-..., /ingest/run-...), so it appears in the platform row (Data, Properties.path)\n  and in the receipt. This is the join that works.\n- OperationId does NOT join (0 of 129+ egress rows share an app OperationId).\n- The ui-... and harness ids are NOT linked to run-... by any row.\n- Proof = platform Deny/Enforced row AND no receipt (read >= 180 s later) next to the Allow row + receipt for the permitted call.\n- App spans for enforced runs do NOT reach App Insights; link to a missing app span is NOT VERIFIED.",
      "originalText": "run-id CORRELATION (observed, telemetry-map 0.12-0.14)\n- The run-... id is in the URL PATH (/policy/run-..., /ingest/run-...), so it appears in the platform row (Data, Properties.path)\n  and in the receipt. This is the join that works.\n- OperationId does NOT join (0 of 129+ egress rows share an app OperationId).\n- The ui-... and harness ids are NOT linked to run-... by any row.\n- Proof = platform Deny/Enforced row AND no receipt (read >= 180 s later) next to the Allow row + receipt for the permitted call.\n- App spans for enforced runs do NOT reach App Insights; link to a missing app span is NOT VERIFIED.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "n_run",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "b0G"
    },
